1713
00:55:40,280 --> 00:55:40,600
Exactly.

1714
00:55:40,600 --> 00:55:41,120
With this,

1715
00:55:41,120 --> 00:55:41,920
you don't even need perfume.

1716
00:55:41,920 --> 00:55:43,520
You can look and feel great every day.

1717
00:55:46,740 --> 00:55:47,540
(Love to see it)
That was amazing.

1718
00:55:47,920 --> 00:55:49,280
Our hopes never seem

1719
00:55:49,280 --> 00:55:50,200
(All answers wrong, no Heart Stones)
to come true.

1720
00:55:50,200 --> 00:55:51,280
It's okay. Hold on.

1721
00:55:51,280 --> 00:55:52,080
Just wait a little longer.

1722
00:55:52,280 --> 00:55:53,120
So Chaoyue

1723
00:55:53,120 --> 00:55:54,240
still has eight stones.

1724
00:55:54,240 --> 00:55:55,040
And with these two stones,

1725
00:55:55,920 --> 00:55:57,400
(Got both right, earns 2 Heart Stones)
you've caught right up.

1726
00:55:57,400 --> 00:55:58,080
Seven.

1727
00:55:58,080 --> 00:55:59,000
Seven stones now.

1728
00:55:59,000 --> 00:55:59,720
(Three got 1 answer right)
One each.

1729
00:55:59,720 --> 00:56:00,670
(Each earns 1 Heart Stone)
One each.

1730
00:56:00,680 --> 00:56:01,520
All right, this City Date

1731
00:56:01,520 --> 00:56:02,240
was something Chen Hewen

1732
00:56:02,240 --> 00:56:03,560
finally made happen.

1733
00:56:03,560 --> 00:56:05,040
And after he and Sha Yue'er

1734
00:56:05,040 --> 00:56:06,440
missed out on two big dates

1735
00:56:06,440 --> 00:56:07,560
in a row,

1736
00:56:07,560 --> 00:56:08,760
this will be

1737
00:56:08,760 --> 00:56:09,560
their first date alone.

1738
00:56:09,560 --> 00:56:10,360
I really can't wait

1739
00:56:10,360 --> 00:56:11,400
to see it.

1740
00:56:11,400 --> 00:56:11,880
Here we go!

1741
00:56:12,880 --> 00:56:13,520
His moment.

1742
00:56:13,520 --> 00:56:15,400
(Next episode)

1743
00:56:15,400 --> 00:56:16,400
You're good.

1744
00:56:16,520 --> 00:56:17,440
Seriously impressive.

1745
00:56:17,440 --> 00:56:18,440
You had me running all over the court.

1746
00:56:18,440 --> 00:56:19,160
About what you asked earlier,

1747
00:56:19,160 --> 00:56:20,880
my answer's always been the same.

1748
00:56:22,840 --> 00:56:23,560
If I didn't come to you,

1749
00:56:23,560 --> 00:56:24,680
how long would it
take you to come to me?

1750
00:56:25,160 --> 00:56:26,240
Here we go again.

1751
00:56:26,240 --> 00:56:27,680
Have I always been

1752
00:56:27,680 --> 00:56:29,040
the one you're most interested in?

1753
00:56:29,900 --> 00:56:30,500
(Confidential)

1754
00:56:32,820 --> 00:56:33,950
Oh my God.

1755
00:56:33,960 --> 00:56:35,360
Are they about to get together?

1756
00:56:36,000 --> 00:56:36,820
(Pouts)
So cute.

1757
00:56:37,120 --> 00:56:37,760
Looks good.

1758
00:56:37,760 --> 00:56:39,600
Honestly, none of them
really look like me.

1759
00:56:39,940 --> 00:56:41,040
(Covers mouth and laughs)
They don't really look like you?

1760
00:56:41,040 --> 00:56:41,720
Yeah.

1761
00:56:41,820 --> 00:56:43,080
(Covers mouth and laughs)

1762
00:56:43,080 --> 00:56:45,200
We're starting to talk more
and more alike.

1763
00:56:46,480 --> 00:56:47,200
Do you think...

1764
00:56:47,200 --> 00:56:47,540
(Confidential)

1765
00:56:49,600 --> 00:56:50,240
What?

1766
00:56:50,240 --> 00:56:51,320
Did you not hear me,

1767
00:56:51,320 --> 00:56:52,720
or do you want me to say it again?

1768
00:56:52,720 --> 00:56:53,640
I want to hear it again.

1769
00:56:57,160 --> 00:56:57,920
They're still not back.

1770
00:56:58,040 --> 00:56:59,660
So should I still...

1771
00:56:59,660 --> 00:57:00,700
(Takes out the card)
you know?

1772
00:57:01,400 --> 00:57:02,680
He opened the Stargazing Room.

1773
00:57:02,840 --> 00:57:03,600
What's the rush?

1774
00:57:04,040 --> 00:57:05,120
Let's go rowing, bro.

1775
00:57:06,480 --> 00:57:08,160
I was thinking maybe
I shouldn't give it to her.

1776
00:57:08,360 --> 00:57:11,920
All I can say is, I give in.

1777
00:57:12,400 --> 00:57:13,680
Chen Hewen's whole vibe has changed.

1778
00:57:13,720 --> 00:57:14,920
Want some more?

1779
00:57:16,440 --> 00:57:17,480
Look at you.

1780
00:57:17,640 --> 00:57:18,760
This is

1781
00:57:18,760 --> 00:57:20,480
the photo Meng took

1782
00:57:20,480 --> 00:57:21,200
of you a few days ago.

1783
00:57:21,560 --> 00:57:22,480
He's gonna give it to her.

1784
00:57:24,480 --> 00:57:25,520
This is too good!

1785
00:57:27,060 --> 00:57:53,500
(Heart Signal (China Version) S9,
Viewing Calendar)

1786
00:58:04,760 --> 00:58:07,480
♪Morning steam rises
from breakfast stalls♪

1787
00:58:07,480 --> 00:58:10,080
♪Packed subway cars,
barely room to breathe♪

1788
00:58:10,080 --> 00:58:14,280
♪Still half asleep, another day begins♪

1789
00:58:15,440 --> 00:58:18,160
♪The city glows beneath the towers♪

1790
00:58:18,160 --> 00:58:20,800
♪Somewhere beyond the clouds,
a sweet little date awaits♪

1791
00:58:20,800 --> 00:58:24,880
♪But first,
there are endless meetings to survive♪

1792
00:58:25,600 --> 00:58:27,000
♪Even if the fairy tale
only lasts a day♪

1793
