♪Cupid's arrow is already on its way♪

1797
00:58:32,280 --> 00:58:33,680
♪Don't act like you didn't see it♪

1798
00:58:33,680 --> 00:58:36,640
♪Just be a little braver♪

1799
00:58:36,640 --> 00:58:37,880
♪Keep moving♪

1800
00:58:38,000 --> 00:58:39,480
♪Keep moving♪

1801
00:58:39,480 --> 00:58:42,840
♪There's a little spark shining
in your eyes♪

1802
00:58:45,200 --> 00:58:47,560
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪

1803
00:58:58,000 --> 00:59:00,800
♪Keep moving♪

1804
00:59:00,800 --> 00:59:03,440
♪Life can be complicated,
yet beautifully simple♪

1805
00:59:03,440 --> 00:59:06,080
♪Go discover♪

1806
00:59:06,080 --> 00:59:08,760
♪That heartbeat you've been longing
to let out♪

1807
00:59:08,760 --> 00:59:11,440
♪Come closer♪

1808
00:59:11,440 --> 00:59:14,840
♪There's a little spark shining
